    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dŭplāris</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		duplus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>containing double</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numerus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">miles,</span>”
				<i>one who receives double pay as a reward</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 2, 7</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also in the form DUPLARIUS,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 2003</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3476 al.</span></i>, v. duplicarius.</div>
